# bat configuration: one command-line argument per line.
#
# Matches the gruvbox dark used by ghostty, tmux and nvim. `gruvbox-dark` is
# built in, so no `bat cache --build` is needed.
--theme="gruvbox-dark"

# Tab display width, matching nvim's global tabstop. Only affects files that
# contain literal tabs, and expandtab means ours never do.
--tabs=2
